{
  "title": "Quick Pungent Mexican Cheese Chiles Rellenos",
  "description": "A lacto-vegetarian friendly Mexican dish featuring filo pastry and broiled to perfection, this recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "diet": [
